  "title": {
    "rendered": "ዜና በረከት"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>ብጹዕ አቡነ ፋኑኤል የአሜሪካ ዲሲ እና አከባቢው ሀገረ ስብከት ሊቀጳጳስ እማማ ዘውዲቱ እና ልጆቻቸውን ጎበኙ። በጉብኝታቸው ወቅት በሳቸው የበላይ ጠባቂነት የተቋቋመው የቅዱስ ዮሀንስ በጎ አድራጎት ማህበር የእስፖንሰርሺፕ ድጋፍ ከማበርከታቸውም በላይ ጸሎተ ብራኬ ሰጥተው ወደፊት ከእማማ ዘውዲቱ እና ከልጆቻቸው እንደማይሉ ቃል በመግባት አበረታተዋል።<br />\n***<br />\nብጹዕነትዎ ረጅም ዕድሜ ከጤና ጋር ይስጥልን</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-814 size-medium\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2-225x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2-225x300.jpg 225w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2-18x24.jpg 18w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2-27x36.jpg 27w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2-36x48.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel2.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 225px) 100vw, 225px\" /></a> <a href=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-812 size-medium\" src=\"http://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2-300x229.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"229\" srcset=\"https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2-300x229.jpg 300w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2-24x18.jpg 24w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2-36x28.jpg 36w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2-48x37.jpg 48w, https://zewditumeshesha.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/abune-fanuel-2.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>ብጹዕ አቡነ ፋኑኤል የአሜሪካ ዲሲ እና አከባቢው ሀገረ ስብከት ሊቀጳጳስ እማማ ዘውዲቱ እና ልጆቻቸውን ጎበኙ። በጉብኝታቸው ወቅት በሳቸው የበላይ ጠባቂነት የተቋቋመው የቅዱስ ዮሀንስ በጎ አድራጎት ማህበር የእስፖንሰርሺፕ ድጋፍ ከማበርከታቸውም በላይ ጸሎተ ብራኬ ሰጥተው ወደፊት ከእማማ ዘውዲቱ እና ከልጆቻቸው እንደማይሉ ቃል በመግባት አበረታተዋል። *** ብጹዕነትዎ ረጅም ዕድሜ ከጤና ጋር ይስጥልን</p>\n",
